---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Bonfire — Mosaic
description: Not an agency, but a co-design partnership. Mosaic pairs your knowledge of your community with our federated software, and everything we build goes back into the commons.
---
{% set eyebrow = "flex items-center gap-3 font-smono text-[1rem] font-bold tracking-[.18em]" %}
{% set display = "mt-4 font-disp font-[560] text-[clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.35rem)] leading-[1.06] tracking-[-.02em] text-balance [font-variation-settings:'opsz'_96]" %}
{% set bodyp = "mt-3.5 text-[1.02rem] text-ink-2 max-w-[42rem]" %}
{% set btnfire = "btn h-auto min-h-0 rounded-full border-0 px-[1.4rem] py-[.85rem] font-smono text-[.78rem] font-bold tracking-[.05em] text-[#221302] bg-gradient-to-br from-spark via-flame to-ember hover:from-spark hover:via-flame hover:to-ember shadow-[0_6px_26px_-8px_rgba(232,145,43,.55)]" %}
{% set btnline = "btn btn-ghost h-auto min-h-0 rounded-full px-[1.4rem] py-[.85rem] font-smono text-[.78rem] font-bold tracking-[.05em] text-ink border border-ink/15 bg-ink/[0.03] hover:border-flame hover:text-spark hover:bg-ink/[0.03]" %}
{% set ph = "border border-dashed border-ink/15 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-center font-smono text-[.72rem] text-ink-3 p-[18px] leading-[1.6] bg-[repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,transparent_0_22px,rgba(242,236,219,.022)_22px_44px)] pointer-events-none [&_.tag]:text-flame" %}
{% set phin = "flex items-center justify-center text-center font-smono text-[.72rem] text-ink-3 p-[18px] leading-[1.6] bg-[repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,transparent_0_22px,rgba(242,236,219,.022)_22px_44px)] pointer-events-none [&_.tag]:text-flame" %}
{% set arrow = "w-9 h-9 flex-none grid place-items-center rounded-[7px] border border-ink/15 bg-night-2 text-ink font-smono text-base leading-none cursor-pointer disabled:opacity-25 disabled:cursor-default enabled:hover:border-flame enabled:hover:text-flame" %}
{% set hint = "inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 font-smono text-[.68rem] font-bold tracking-[.16em] text-ink-3" %}
{% set hscroll = "flex gap-5 overflow-x-auto pb-[18px] snap-x snap-proximity cursor-grab select-none [scrollbar-width:none] [&::-webkit-scrollbar]:hidden [-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch] [overscroll-behavior-x:contain] [touch-action:pan-y]" %}
{% set hcap = "mt-[13px] text-[.94rem] text-ink-2 [&_b]:font-disp [&_b]:text-ink [&_b]:font-semibold" %}
{% set tile = "relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-ink/15 bg-night-2" %}
{% set tcap = "px-4 py-3.5 border-t border-ink/[0.07] text-[.9rem] text-ink-2 [&_b]:font-disp [&_b]:text-ink [&_b]:block [&_b]:mb-0.5" %}
{% set ttype = "absolute top-2.5 left-2.5 z-[3] font-smono text-[.58rem] tracking-[.1em] text-ink-3 bg-night/75 border border-ink/15 rounded-[7px] px-[7px] py-[3px]" %}

<div class="relative overflow-x-clip bg-night text-ink font-body leading-[1.55] antialiased selection:bg-ember selection:text-[#160c02]">
  <div class="v2-ambient" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="relative z-[1]">

    {# ===== hero ===== #}
    <header class="pt-[34px] pb-2.5">
    <div class="max-w-[1180px] mx-auto px-7">
      <p class="{{ eyebrow }} text-flame">Bonfire Mosaic</p>
      <h1 class="mt-[18px] font-disp font-semibold text-[clamp(2rem,4.6vw,3.5rem)] leading-[1.05] text-balance max-w-[16ch] [font-variation-settings:'opsz'_96]">Not an agency. <span class="fire-text">A co-design partnership.</span></h1>
      <p class="mt-5 text-[1.12rem] text-ink-2 max-w-[52ch]">You know how your community works: the roles, the rituals, the arguments, the things that go wrong at 11pm. We know how to build federated software. <b class="text-ink font-semibold">Mosaic is those two things in a room together</b>. Everything we make goes back into the commons.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-[26px]">
        <a class="{{ btnfire }}" href="https://cal.com/bonfire-networks/meet">Book a call</a>
        <a class="{{ btnline }}" href="#built">See what we've built</a>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-5 font-smono text-[.72rem] text-ink-3">◼ For communities without a technical team, or who already have too many pots on the fire.</p>

      {# hero gallery: the work #}
      <div class="mt-[26px]" data-gal>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-3">
          <button type="button" class="js-prev {{ arrow }}" aria-label="Previous">←</button>
          <button type="button" class="js-next {{ arrow }}" aria-label="Next">→</button>
          <span class="{{ hint }}">Spaces we've built </span>
        </div>
        <div class="{{ hscroll }}" data-hscroll>
          <figure class="flex-none w-[clamp(320px,92vw,900px)] snap-start m-0"> 
            <div class="{{ ph }} aspect-[16/10] w-full"><span class="max-w-[32ch]"><span class="tag">[ IMG — Jacobin ]</span><br>their community space, in their brand: a discussion under an article</span></div>
            <figcaption class="{{ hcap }}"><b>Jacobin.</b> A magazine's readers, debating in a space they own.</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <figure class="flex-none w-[clamp(320px,92vw,900px)] snap-start m-0">
            <div class="{{ ph }} aspect-[16/10] w-full"><span class="max-w-[32ch]"><span class="tag">[ IMG — Open Science Network ]</span><br>a researcher profile with imported publications &amp; a paper unfolding with its DOI</span></div>
            <figcaption class="{{ hcap }}"><b>Open Science Network.</b> Built with working scholars, around how research really happens.</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <figure class="flex-none w-[clamp(320px,92vw,900px)] snap-start m-0">
            <div class="{{ ph }} aspect-[16/10] w-full"><span class="max-w-[32ch]"><span class="tag">[ IMG — Mentaal.nl ]</span><br>a private, invite-only group with careful boundaries</span></div>
            <figcaption class="{{ hcap }}"><b>Mentaal.nl.</b> A care coalition's private, self-governed home.</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div></header>

    {# ===== how we work ===== #}
    <section class="py-16 border-t border-ink/[0.07]">
    <div class="max-w-[1180px] mx-auto px-7">
      <p class="{{ eyebrow }} text-flame">How we work</p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 min-[821px]:grid-cols-3 gap-px mt-[26px] rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-ink/15 bg-ink/15">
        <div class="bg-night px-6 py-[26px]">
          <span class="font-smono text-[.68rem] tracking-[.1em] uppercase text-ink-3">01 — before we build</span>
          <h3 class="font-disp font-[620] text-[1.12rem] mt-[11px] mb-2">We listen first</h3>
          <p class="text-ink-2 text-[.94rem] m-0">Research and workshops with your people, then we shape the space around what we learn. You decide how your community should run; we translate that into software.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-night px-6 py-[26px]">
          <span class="font-smono text-[.68rem] tracking-[.1em] uppercase text-ink-3">02 — what you keep</span>
          <h3 class="font-disp font-[620] text-[1.12rem] mt-[11px] mb-2">You own all of it</h3>
          <p class="text-ink-2 text-[.94rem] m-0">AGPL, forkable, yours. Run it yourself, or take it to another team, whenever you like. Nothing here is a hostage situation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-night px-6 py-[26px]">
          <span class="font-smono text-[.68rem] tracking-[.1em] uppercase text-ink-3">03 — after launch</span>
          <h3 class="font-disp font-[620] text-[1.12rem] mt-[11px] mb-2">We stay</h3>
          <p class="text-ink-2 text-[.94rem] m-0">Maintenance <em class="italic text-flame">is</em> the job. Hosting, updates, and a human to call when it breaks. The unglamorous part is the part that matters.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div></section>

    {# ===== one system — bento ===== #}
    <section id="system" class="py-16 border-t border-ink/[0.07] scroll-mt-[70px]">
    <div class="max-w-[1180px] mx-auto px-7">
      <p class="{{ eyebrow }} text-flame">What you're actually getting</p>
      <h2 class="{{ display }} max-w-[26ch]">Your website and your community, <span class="font-light">finally the same thing.</span></h2>
      <p class="{{ bodyp }}">Most organisations run a website in one place, a community somewhere else, and a pile of tools in between, none of them talking. Mosaic is one system: the public face, the conversation, and the tools you rely on. All federated, all yours.</p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 min-[601px]:grid-cols-6 min-[901px]:grid-cols-12 gap-4 mt-[34px]">

        {# the website, with the community physically overlapping it #}
        <div class="{{ tile }} min-[601px]:col-span-6 min-[901px]:col-span-8">
          <span class="{{ ttype }}">Browser screenshot</span>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-[7px] px-3 py-[9px] bg-night-3 border-b border-ink/15">
            <i class="w-[9px] h-[9px] rounded-full bg-[#33343d]"></i><i class="w-[9px] h-[9px] rounded-full bg-[#33343d]"></i><i class="w-[9px] h-[9px] rounded-full bg-[#33343d]"></i>
            <span class="ml-2 font-smono text-[.62rem] text-ink-3 bg-black/30 px-2.5 py-[3px] rounded-full">yourcommunity.org</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1 relative min-h-[300px]">
            <div class="{{ phin }} absolute inset-0"><span class="max-w-[32ch]"><span class="tag">[ IMG — the website ]</span><br>public pages &amp; posts, in your own identity</span></div>
            <div class="absolute right-4 bottom-4 w-[52%] min-w-[220px] z-[2] rounded-xl border border-ink/15 overflow-hidden bg-night-3 shadow-[0_24px_60px_-18px_rgba(0,0,0,.9)] max-[600px]:static max-[600px]:w-auto max-[600px]:min-w-0 max-[600px]:shadow-none max-[600px]:m-2.5">
              <div class="font-smono text-[.58rem] tracking-[.1em] uppercase text-spark px-2.5 py-1.5 border-b border-ink/15">◼ the same system</div>
              <div class="{{ phin }} aspect-[16/10]"><span class="max-w-[32ch]"><span class="tag">[ IMG — the community ]</span><br>a federated discussion under the article</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="{{ tcap }}"><b>One system, not two.</b> The public face and the conversation, running on the same thing, not just a website with a forum bolted on the side.</div>
        </div>

        {# mobile crop #}
        <div class="{{ tile }} min-[601px]:col-span-3 min-[901px]:col-span-4">
          <span class="{{ ttype }}">Mobile crop</span>
          <div class="{{ phin }} flex-1 aspect-[3/4]"><span class="max-w-[32ch]"><span class="tag">[ IMG — on a phone ]</span><br>a member reading &amp; replying, on a slow connection</span></div>
          <div class="{{ tcap }}"><b>Wherever they are.</b> Works on old phones and bad signal. because that's where most of your community actually is.</div>
        </div>

        {# logo strip #}
        <div class="{{ tile }} min-[601px]:col-span-6 min-[901px]:col-span-5 justify-center">
          <span class="{{ ttype }}">Logo strip</span>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2.5 px-[22px] py-[26px]">
            {% for l in ["Ghost", "WordPress", "Drupal", "ORCID", "Mastodon", "Bluesky", "Matrix", "your CRM"] %}<span class="font-smono text-[.76rem] text-ink-2 border border-ink/15 rounded-[7px] px-3 py-2">{{ l }}</span>{% endfor %}
          </div>
          <div class="{{ tcap }}"><b>Bring what you already use.</b> Keep the tools that work; we wire them in. Anything missing becomes a new block.</div>
        </div>

        {# detail crop #}
        <div class="{{ tile }} min-[601px]:col-span-3 min-[901px]:col-span-3">
          <span class="{{ ttype }}">Detail crop</span>
          <div class="{{ phin }} flex-1 aspect-square"><span class="max-w-[32ch]"><span class="tag">[ IMG — zoomed ]</span><br>a reply arriving from a Mastodon account</span></div>
          <div class="{{ tcap }}"><b>No new account.</b> They reply from wherever they already are.</div>
        </div>

        {# typographic tile — text as the image #}
        <div class="{{ tile }} min-[601px]:col-span-6 min-[901px]:col-span-4 justify-center px-6 py-[26px] border-flame/30 bg-[linear-gradient(150deg,rgba(245,195,68,.1),rgba(255,223,130,.05))]">
          <span class="{{ ttype }}">Typographic tile</span>
          <div>
            <div class="font-disp font-[640] text-[clamp(2.4rem,4vw,3.4rem)] leading-none tracking-[-.03em] text-flame">0</div>
            <div class="text-ink-2 text-[.95rem] mt-2">extra sign-ups for anyone already on the fediverse.</div>
            <div class="h-px bg-ink/15 my-[18px]"></div>
            <div class="font-disp font-[640] text-[clamp(2.4rem,4vw,3.4rem)] leading-none tracking-[-.03em] text-flame">0</div>
            <div class="text-ink-2 text-[.95rem] mt-2">cookie banners. Privacy-friendly analytics, nothing sold to anyone.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        {# diagram #}
        <div class="{{ tile }} min-[601px]:col-span-6 min-[901px]:col-span-7">
          <span class="{{ ttype }}">Diagram</span>
          <div class="{{ phin }} flex-1 aspect-[16/7]"><span class="max-w-[32ch]"><span class="tag">[ DIAGRAM — one way in ]</span><br>a member moving site → community → back, signed in once · the seam that isn't there</span></div>
          <div class="{{ tcap }}"><b>One way in.</b> Members move between your site and your community without noticing a seam.</div>
        </div>

        {# woodcut art — breathing room #}
        <div class="{{ tile }} min-[601px]:col-span-6 min-[901px]:col-span-5">
          <span class="{{ ttype }}">Illustration</span>
          <div class="{{ phin }} flex-1 aspect-video"><span class="max-w-[32ch]"><span class="tag">[ ART — woodcut ]</span><br>the gathering at the fire · texture, not a UI</span></div>
          <div class="{{ tcap }}"><b>And it's built by a network of Bonfire developers</b>, not an agency with a sales team. Which is also why it costs what it costs.</div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div></section>

    {# ===== proof ===== #}
    <section id="built" class="py-16 border-t border-ink/[0.07] scroll-mt-[70px]">
    <div class="max-w-[1180px] mx-auto px-7">
      <p class="{{ eyebrow }} text-flame">Who we've built with</p>
      <h2 class="{{ display }} max-w-[24ch]">Three communities. <span class="font-light">Three completely different spaces.</span></h2>
      <p class="{{ bodyp }}">Same foundation, shaped three ways, because a magazine, a research network and a care coalition need almost nothing in common.</p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 min-[821px]:grid-cols-3 gap-[18px] mt-[26px]">
        <a class="card rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-ink/15 hover:border-ink/25" href="/case-studies/jacobin/">
          <div class="{{ phin }} aspect-video border-b border-dashed border-ink/15"><span><span class="tag">[ CASE ]</span><br>Jacobin</span></div>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-[9px] flex-1 px-5 py-[22px]">
            <span class="font-smono text-[.66rem] tracking-[.12em] uppercase text-flame">A magazine</span>
            <h3 class="font-disp font-[620] text-[1.18rem] leading-[1.12]">From audience to community</h3>
            <p class="text-ink-2 text-[.93rem] m-0">Readers who debate and belong, not a comment box. Publishing stayed on their Ghost site; the community lives on Bonfire, wearing their brand.</p>
            <div class="mt-auto pt-[13px] border-t border-ink/[0.07] font-smono text-[.72rem] text-ink-3 flex justify-between gap-2"><b class="text-ink font-normal">3,000+ readers</b><span class="text-spark">Read →</span></div>
          </div>
        </a>
        <div class="card rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-ink/15">
          <div class="{{ phin }} aspect-video border-b border-dashed border-ink/15"><span><span class="tag">[ CASE ]</span><br>Open Science Network</span></div>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-[9px] flex-1 px-5 py-[22px]">
            <span class="font-smono text-[.66rem] tracking-[.12em] uppercase text-flame">A research network</span>
            <h3 class="font-disp font-[620] text-[1.18rem] leading-[1.12]">A commons for scholars</h3>
            <p class="text-ink-2 text-[.93rem] m-0">Co-designed with working researchers: ORCID sign-in, publications on your profile, papers that unfold with their DOI.</p>
            <div class="mt-auto pt-[13px] border-t border-ink/[0.07] font-smono text-[.72rem] text-ink-3 flex justify-between gap-2"><b class="text-ink font-normal">Built with academics</b><span class="text-spark">Read →</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-ink/15">
          <div class="{{ phin }} aspect-video border-b border-dashed border-ink/15"><span><span class="tag">[ CASE ]</span><br>Mentaal.nl</span></div>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-[9px] flex-1 px-5 py-[22px]">
            <span class="font-smono text-[.66rem] tracking-[.12em] uppercase text-flame">A mental-health network</span>
            <h3 class="font-disp font-[620] text-[1.18rem] leading-[1.12]">A safe space that's theirs</h3>
            <p class="text-ink-2 text-[.93rem] m-0">Private, invite-only, carefully moderated. Safety and governance designed in from the first workshop, not bolted on.</p>
            <div class="mt-auto pt-[13px] border-t border-ink/[0.07] font-smono text-[.72rem] text-ink-3 flex justify-between gap-2"><b class="text-ink font-normal">500+ members</b><span class="text-spark">Read →</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div></section>

    {# ===== process ===== #}
    <section id="how" class="py-16 border-t border-ink/[0.07] scroll-mt-[70px]">
    <div class="max-w-[1180px] mx-auto px-7">
      <p class="{{ eyebrow }} text-corn">How it goes</p>
      <h2 class="{{ display }} max-w-[22ch]">What actually happens <span class="font-light">if you call us.</span></h2>

      <div class="mt-[26px]" data-gal>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-3">
          <button type="button" class="js-prev {{ arrow }}" aria-label="Previous">←</button>
          <button type="button" class="js-next {{ arrow }}" aria-label="Next">→</button>
          <span class="{{ hint }}">Co-design, in the room — drag ⟶</span>
        </div>
        <div class="{{ hscroll }}" data-hscroll>
          <figure class="flex-none w-[clamp(240px,70vw,360px)] snap-start m-0">
            <div class="{{ ph }} aspect-[4/5] w-full"><span class="max-w-[32ch]"><span class="tag">[ PHOTO ]</span><br>a workshop with the community</span></div>
            <figcaption class="{{ hcap }}"><b>Listening.</b> Interviews and workshops with the people who'll actually use it.</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <figure class="flex-none w-[clamp(240px,70vw,360px)] snap-start m-0">
            <div class="{{ ph }} aspect-[4/5] w-full"><span class="max-w-[32ch]"><span class="tag">[ PHOTO ]</span><br>sticky notes / mapping how a community decides</span></div>
            <figcaption class="{{ hcap }}"><b>Mapping.</b> Who decides what and how, before a line of code is written.</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <figure class="flex-none w-[clamp(240px,70vw,360px)] snap-start m-0">
            <div class="{{ ph }} aspect-[4/5] w-full"><span class="max-w-[32ch]"><span class="tag">[ IMG ]</span><br>sketches &amp; wireframes of the space</span></div>
            <figcaption class="{{ hcap }}"><b>Sketching.</b> Flows and screens, argued over together.</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <figure class="flex-none w-[clamp(240px,70vw,360px)] snap-start m-0">
            <div class="{{ ph }} aspect-[4/5] w-full"><span class="max-w-[32ch]"><span class="tag">[ IMG ]</span><br>the built space, side by side with the sketch</span></div>
            <figcaption class="{{ hcap }}"><b>Building.</b> Mostly assembling blocks that already exist.</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <figure class="flex-none w-[clamp(240px,70vw,360px)] snap-start m-0">
            <div class="{{ ph }} aspect-[4/5] w-full"><span class="max-w-[32ch]"><span class="tag">[ PHOTO ]</span><br>training session with facilitators &amp; mods</span></div>
            <figcaption class="{{ hcap }}"><b>Handing over.</b> Training the people who'll run it day to day.</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>
      </div>

      {% set stepn = "font-smono text-[.75rem] text-flame tracking-[.08em]" %}
      {% set steph = "font-disp font-[620] text-[1.25rem]" %}
      {% set stepw = "font-smono text-[.68rem] text-ink-3 mt-2" %}
      {% set stepp = "text-ink-2 text-[.97rem] m-0 col-start-2 min-[821px]:col-start-auto" %}
      {% set steprow = "grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] min-[821px]:grid-cols-[auto_1fr_1fr] gap-4 min-[821px]:gap-7 items-baseline px-1 py-[26px] border-b border-ink/15" %}
      <div class="mt-7 border-t border-ink/15">
        <div class="{{ steprow }}">
          <span class="{{ stepn }}">01</span>
          <div><h3 class="{{ steph }}">We listen</h3><div class="{{ stepw }}">Weeks 1–2</div></div>
          <p class="{{ stepp }}">Interviews and workshops with your people. How do you actually gather? Who decides what? Where does it break down today? We've never yet found a community that works the way its org chart says.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="{{ steprow }}">
          <span class="{{ stepn }}">02</span>
          <div><h3 class="{{ steph }}">We co-design</h3><div class="{{ stepw }}">Weeks 2–5</div></div>
          <p class="{{ stepp }}">Together we shape the space: the circles, the roles, the boundaries, the flows. You make the calls about how your community should run; we work out what that means in software.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="{{ steprow }}">
          <span class="{{ stepn }}">03</span>
          <div><h3 class="{{ steph }}">We build</h3><div class="{{ stepw }}">Weeks 5–12+</div></div>
          <p class="{{ stepp }}">Mostly this is assembling blocks that already exist. We only write new code where something genuinely doesn't exist yet, and when we do, it becomes a block anyone can reuse.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="{{ steprow }}">
          <span class="{{ stepn }}">04</span>
          <div><h3 class="{{ steph }}">We hand it over</h3><div class="{{ stepw }}">Launch</div></div>
          <p class="{{ stepp }}">Your brand, your language, your governance, and training for the people who'll actually run it day to day: your facilitators and your moderators.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="{{ steprow }}">
          <span class="{{ stepn }}">05</span>
          <div><h3 class="{{ steph }}">We keep it alive</h3><div class="{{ stepw }}">Ongoing</div></div>
          <p class="{{ stepp }}">Hosting, updates, backups, and a human to call. Or we teach your team to run it themselves and step back. Both are fine, what's not fine is leaving you stranded.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div></section>

    {# ===== what you get ===== #}
    <section class="py-16 border-t border-ink/[0.07]">
    <div class="max-w-[1180px] mx-auto px-7">
      <p class="{{ eyebrow }} text-flame">What you end up with</p>
      <h2 class="{{ display }} max-w-[20ch]">A space that's <span class="font-light">actually yours.</span></h2>

      <p class="{{ bodyp }} mb-1">A mosaic of small decisions: colours, words, roles, the shape of the front page, that add up to somewhere your members recognise as theirs.</p>
      {% set mtile = "rounded-xl border border-ink/15 overflow-hidden relative flex items-center justify-center text-center p-3.5 text-ink-3 font-smono text-[.7rem] leading-[1.5] bg-[repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,transparent_0_22px,rgba(242,236,219,.022)_22px_44px)] [&_.tag]:text-flame [&_.tag]:block [&_.tag]:mb-1" %}
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 min-[761px]:grid-cols-6 auto-rows-[120px] min-[761px]:auto-rows-[140px] gap-3 mt-[26px]">
